WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:03.733
Unit eighteen. Tobacco Control!

2
00:00:04.666 --> 00:00:09.579
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.629 --> 00:00:12.459
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.509 --> 00:00:16.340
Today we learn about Tobacco Control. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.318 --> 00:00:22.285
Tobacco control. Say it with me. Tobacco control!

6
00:00:25.765 --> 00:00:29.232
Tax. Say it with me. Tax!

7
00:00:32.758 --> 00:00:37.675
Advertising ban. Say it with me. Advertising ban!

8
00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:45.791
Warning labels. Say it with me. Warning labels!

9
00:00:49.297 --> 00:00:54.447
Smoke-free. Say it with me. Smoke-free!

10
00:00:57.905 --> 00:01:01.739
Quit support. Say it with me. Quit support!

11
00:01:05.236 --> 00:01:08.820
Policy. Say it with me. Policy!

12
00:01:12.324 --> 00:01:15.557
Youth. Say it with me. Youth!

13
00:01:19.065 --> 00:01:30.785
Tobacco control policies include higher tax, an advertising ban, warning labels, smoke-free places, and quit support. These policies especially protect youth.

14
00:01:30.835 --> 00:01:34.550
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:35.535 --> 00:01:40.747
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:40.797 --> 00:01:42.304
Advertising ban!

17
00:01:43.504 --> 00:01:48.696
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.746 --> 00:01:49.896
Policy!

19
00:01:50.802 --> 00:01:58.671
Did you know? Raising tobacco prices is one of the most effective ways to reduce smoking, especially among young people!

20
00:01:58.721 --> 00:02:01.053
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:02.484 --> 00:02:11.339
Think and answer. Which tobacco control policy do you think works best?

22
00:02:11.389 --> 00:02:12.539
Great answer!

23
00:02:13.703 --> 00:02:19.184
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
